een easier or more fun.\n\nUser-Friendly Gameplay: Jump right in with no steep learning curve.\n\nIntuitive Design: Navigate effortlessly as you bring your ideas to life.\n\nEndless Creativity: Utilize orbs and cubes to craft anything you can dream up.\n\nSave and Load Projects: Easily continue your work whenever you want.\n\nCreative Space is a must-have for every Meta Quest owner, offering boundless opportunities to express your creativity.", "short_description": "Unleash your creativity in this intuitive, fun, Creative Space."}]}, "developer_name": "John Ray Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://johnray32875.wixsite.com/johnraygames/creative-space", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "John Ray Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://johnray32875.wixsite.com/johnraygames", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ART_CREATIVITY", "CASUAL", "RELAXATION_MEDITATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8491562487523043"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43997714_1217261856296116_5665206870556641672_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yH86aElrzpUQ7kNvwGmQHYQ&_nc_oc=AdoCWxAPXLp33SCpJYLvdrOytvRIjqFh7FofGxmcVXsCwvJcjc63R8nOY9RerML7gO0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=0